   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Ben Carter (E3603) is now in perf-dashboards.\n\nYour saying you own the group doesn't count as an approval on its own, so I submitted the request through the approval system. Because you are both Ben's manager and the group owner, your one approval (APR-4001) covers both requirements, and it's recorded as approved. I then added him to the group and marked ticket T-6016 as resolved."
