   "text": "Thanks, that's great. I'm not sure what APR-4001 is for, though, so I'd like to check before we go further. Can you tell me what I'm approving?\n\nAlso, I'm not sure how the approval piece works on my side. I'd just like to make sure I'm not signing off on something I didn't mean to."
